.SS "\fBASSIMP_API\fP \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiLogStream\fP aiGetPredefinedLogStream (\fBC_ENUM\fP \fBaiDefaultLogStream\fP pStreams, const char * file)"
Get one of the predefine log streams\&. This is the quick'n'easy solution to access \fBAssimp\fP's log system\&. Attaching a log stream can slightly reduce \fBAssimp\fP's overall import performance\&.
.PP
Usage is rather simple (this will stream the log to a file, named log\&.txt, and the stdout stream of the process: 
.PP
.nf
struct aiLogStream c;
c = aiGetPredefinedLogStream(aiDefaultLogStream_FILE,"log\&.txt");
aiAttachLogStream(&c);
c = aiGetPredefinedLogStream(aiDefaultLogStream_STDOUT,NULL);
aiAttachLogStream(&c);

.fi
.PP
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpStreams\fP One of the \fBaiDefaultLogStream\fP enumerated values\&. 
.br
\fIfile\fP Solely for the \fBaiDefaultLogStream_FILE\fP flag: specifies the file to write to\&. Pass NULL for all other flags\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The log stream\&. callback is set to NULL if something went wrong\&. 
.RE
.PP

