.SS "\fBASSIMP_API\fP const \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiScene\fP * aiImportFile (const char * pFile, unsigned int pFlags)"
Reads the given file and returns its content\&.
.PP
If the call succeeds, the imported data is returned in an \fBaiScene\fP structure\&. The data is intended to be read-only, it stays property of the ASSIMP library and will be stable until \fBaiReleaseImport()\fP is called\&. After you're done with it, call \fBaiReleaseImport()\fP to free the resources associated with this file\&. If the import fails, NULL is returned instead\&. Call \fBaiGetErrorString()\fP to retrieve a human-readable error text\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpFile\fP Path and filename of the file to be imported, expected to be a null-terminated c-string\&. NULL is not a valid value\&. 
.br
\fIpFlags\fP Optional post processing steps to be executed after a successful import\&. Provide a bitwise combination of the \fBaiPostProcessSteps\fP flags\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Pointer to the imported data or NULL if the import failed\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBASSIMP_API\fP const \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiScene\fP * aiImportFileEx (const char * pFile, unsigned int pFlags, \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiFileIO\fP * pFS)"
Reads the given file using user-defined I/O functions and returns its content\&.
.PP
If the call succeeds, the imported data is returned in an \fBaiScene\fP structure\&. The data is intended to be read-only, it stays property of the ASSIMP library and will be stable until \fBaiReleaseImport()\fP is called\&. After you're done with it, call \fBaiReleaseImport()\fP to free the resources associated with this file\&. If the import fails, NULL is returned instead\&. Call \fBaiGetErrorString()\fP to retrieve a human-readable error text\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpFile\fP Path and filename of the file to be imported, expected to be a null-terminated c-string\&. NULL is not a valid value\&. 
.br
\fIpFlags\fP Optional post processing steps to be executed after a successful import\&. Provide a bitwise combination of the \fBaiPostProcessSteps\fP flags\&. 
.br
\fIpFS\fP \fBaiFileIO\fP structure\&. Will be used to open the model file itself and any other files the loader needs to open\&. Pass NULL to use the default implementation\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Pointer to the imported data or NULL if the import failed\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Include <aiFileIO\&.h> for the definition of \fBaiFileIO\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBASSIMP_API\fP const \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiScene\fP * aiImportFileExWithProperties (const char * pFile, unsigned int pFlags, \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiFileIO\fP * pFS, const \fBC_STRUCT\fP \fBaiPropertyStore\fP * pProps)"
Same as \fBaiImportFileEx\fP, but adds an extra parameter containing importer settings\&.
.PP
