.br
\fIpFS\fP \fBaiFileIO\fP structure\&. Will be used to open the model file itself and any other files the loader needs to open\&. Pass NULL to use the default implementation\&. 
.br
\fIpProps\fP \fBaiPropertyStore\fP instance containing import settings\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Pointer to the imported data or NULL if the import failed\&. 
