This is a straightforward way to decode models from memory buffers, but it doesn't handle model formats that spread their data across multiple files or even directories\&. Examples include OBJ or MD3, which outsource parts of their material info into external scripts\&. If you need full functionality, provide a custom IOSystem to make \fBAssimp\fP find these files and use the regular \fBaiImportFileEx()\fP/aiImportFileExWithProperties() API\&. 
